1
00:00:00,216 --> 00:00:02,186
(Sheldon:)- Where do you stand on it?
- Strongly pro.

2
00:00:02,351 --> 00:00:05,011
(Leonard:)Then I believe that God
created the world in six days...

3
00:00:05,187 --> 00:00:07,487
(Leonard:)...and on the seventh
he made you to annoy me.

4
00:00:11,994 --> 00:00:13,184
- Hey, guys.
- Hey.

5
00:00:13,362 --> 00:00:16,592
(Sheldon:)Raj, where do you stand
on the anthropic principle?

6
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:18,666
- I'm all for it.
- Thattaboy.

7
00:00:18,834 --> 00:00:21,734
(Leonard:)Why do you believe that he knows
what it is, and I don't?

8
00:00:21,904 --> 00:00:23,334
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard...

9
00:00:23,506 --> 00:00:27,066
(Sheldon:)...let's not take a saw to the branch
we're sitting on, shall we?

10
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:30,780
Hey, if you guys are free tonight
I heard about a spa...

11
00:00:30,946 --> 00:00:33,416
(Raj:)...where you soak your feet
in a pool of fish...

12
00:00:33,582 --> 00:00:35,282
...that eat the dead skin off them.

13
00:00:36,852 --> 00:00:38,912
(Raj:)I don't need to tell you, in Los Angeles...

14
00:00:39,088 --> 00:00:41,078
(Raj:)...sandal season is year round.

15
00:00:42,458 --> 00:00:45,258
- Actually, I'm hanging out with Penny.
- Oh, okay.

16
00:00:45,428 --> 00:00:47,018
(Raj:)Sounds like it's me and you.

17
00:00:47,196 --> 00:00:49,566
(Raj:)How about we sic some guppies
on those puppies?

18
00:00:51,033 --> 00:00:53,523
(Sheldon:)As I've stated before
on numerous occasions...

19
00:00:53,703 --> 00:00:56,463
(Sheldon:)...the only sea creature
I would consider being eaten by...

20
00:00:56,672 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)...is the Kraken. Because the last words
I would hear are "release the Kraken."

